#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — adaptor konfigurasi Next.js."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Instructure UI mengirimkan paket ESM yang harus ditranspilasi oleh Next (`transpilePackages`), masalah yang paling mengganggu saat menjalankan InstUI di Next. `withPantoken` menggabungkan paket-paket InstUI ke dalam daftar tersebut. Bungkus `next.config` Anda, lalu impor `@pantoken/css` di tata letak root Anda untuk token."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"
msgstr "Mengganti nama dan mengekspor ulang [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"

