#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the opt-in base/reset stylesheet: global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\nreset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`, base link), followed by the focus-ring\nrules (a document-level default that targets bare focusables). Only the ring *rules* live here — the\n`--instui-focus-outline-*` custom properties they read ship in the token sheet (`@pantoken/css`), so\n`base.css` no longer redefines them. Load it once, ahead of the component and prose sheets, when\npantoken owns the page."
msgstr "Membangun stylesheet dasar/reset opsional: default dokumen global dari token (box-sizing, reset body\n, permukaan halaman, warna/jenis huruf teks dasar, `color-scheme`, tautan dasar), diikuti oleh aturan focus-ring\n(sebagai default tingkat dokumen yang menargetkan elemen focusable tanpa gaya). Hanya *aturan* ring yang berada di sini — properti kustom `--instui-focus-outline-*` yang mereka baca dikirimkan di lembar token (`@pantoken/css`), sehingga\n`base.css` tidak lagi mendefinisikannya ulang. Muat sekali, sebelum lembar komponen dan prosa, ketika\npantoken menguasai halaman."

#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
