msgstr "Konversi daftar token IR menjadi dokumen DTCG."

#: formats/dtcg/src/functions/toDtcg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A nested DTCG token tree."
msgstr "Pohon token DTCG bersarang."

#: formats/dtcg/src/functions/toDtcg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Convert the default IR to a DTCG tree**"
msgstr "**Konversi IR default menjadi pohon DTCG**"

#: formats/dtcg/src/functions/toDtcg.md formats/less/src/functions/toLess.md
#: formats/scss/src/functions/toScss.md
#: formats/stylus/src/functions/toStylus.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Resolve the dark mode of another theme**"
msgstr "**Tentukan mode gelap dari tema lain**"

#: formats/dtcg/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/dtcg` — the Instructure tokens as a W3C Design Tokens (DTCG) document."
msgstr "`@pantoken/dtcg` — token Instructure sebagai dokumen W3C Design Tokens (DTCG)."

#: formats/dtcg/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default export is the `rebrand` DTCG tree; every theme is available by name. Use\n[toDtcg](functions/toDtcg.md) to convert an arbitrary IR yourself."
msgstr "Ekspor default adalah pohon DTCG `rebrand`; setiap tema tersedia dengan nama. Gunakan\n[toDtcg](functions/toDtcg.md) untuk mengonversi IR apa pun sendiri."

#: formats/dtcg/src/type-aliases/DtcgNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A DTCG token leaf or group."
msgstr "Sebuah daun token DTCG atau grup."

#: formats/dtcg/src/variables/dtcg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `rebrand` theme as a DTCG document (the default)."
msgstr "Tema `rebrand` sebagai dokumen DTCG (bawaan)."

#: formats/dtcg/src/variables/themes.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every theme's DTCG document, keyed by [Theme](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/Theme.md)."
msgstr "Dokumen DTCG untuk setiap tema, dikaitkan dengan [Theme](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/Theme.md)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the icon font."
msgstr "Membangun font ikon."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The [IconFontResult](../interfaces/IconFontResult.md)."
msgstr "Hasil [IconFontResult](../interfaces/IconFontResult.md)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build the full font and write the artifacts**"
msgstr "**Bangun font lengkap dan tulis artefak**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**A custom font name and a subset of icons from another theme**"
msgstr "**Nama font kustom dan subkumpulan ikon dari tema lain**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Produce a filled glyph path for an icon SVG."
msgstr "Hasilkan path glyph terisi untuk SVG ikon."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#: packages/core/src/functions/toVectorDrawable.md
#: packages/core/src/functions/toXcodeImageset.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline SVG markup."
msgstr "Markup SVG sebaris."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled path `d` (in viewBox coordinates) and the viewBox size."
msgstr "Path terisi `d` (dalam koordinat viewBox) dan ukuran viewBox."

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Outline a stroke-based (Lucide) icon and a fill-based icon**"
msgstr "**Gambarkan ikon berbasis goresan (Lucide) dan ikon berbasis isian**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/icon-font` — build an installable Instructure icon font (WOFF2 + TTF) with a matching\nstylesheet and codepoint map. Unlike the inline-SVG paths, a font installs on a device, so it\nworks in design apps and offline contexts where the web tooling isn't reachable."
msgstr "`@pantoken/icon-font` — membangun font ikon Instructure yang dapat diinstal (WOFF2 + TTF) dengan stylesheet dan peta codepoint yang sesuai. Berbeda dengan jalur SVG-inline, font terpasang pada perangkat, sehingga berfungsi di aplikasi desain dan konteks offline di mana alat web tidak dapat dijangkau."

#: formats/icon-font/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stroke-based glyphs (Lucide) are outlined to fills so they render as real font glyphs; fill-based\nglyphs (Instructure custom) pass through."
msgstr "Glyph berbasis stroke (Lucide) diubah menjadi isian sehingga dirender sebagai glyph font nyata; glyph berbasis isian (kustom Instructure) diteruskan apa adanya."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildIconFont](../functions/buildIconFont.md)."
msgstr "Opsi untuk [buildIconFont](../functions/buildIconFont.md)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to include (default: the whole set)."
msgstr "Nama ikon yang akan disertakan (default: seluruh kumpulan)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The font family name (default `\"PanTokens\"`)."
msgstr "Nama keluarga font (default `\"PanTokens\"`)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to source glyphs from (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Tema sumber glif (default `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/GlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A filled glyph path plus the SVG viewBox size to wrap it in."
msgstr "Sebuah jalur glif yang terisi serta ukuran viewBox SVG untuk membungkusnya."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated font artifacts."
msgstr "Artefak font yang dihasilkan."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The TrueType font bytes."
msgstr "Byte font TrueType."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The WOFF2 font bytes."
msgstr "Byte font WOFF2."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `@font-face` + `.instui-icon-<name>` stylesheet."
msgstr "The `@font-face` + `.instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` stylesheet."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon name → hex codepoint (e.g. `\"e001\"`)."
msgstr "Nama ikon → kode poin heksadesimal (mis. `\"e001\"`)."

#: formats/icons/src/functions/buildIconResolverChain.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared icon-resolver chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in pantoken icon set. Used by `@pantoken/rehype` and\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` so the resolution order stays identical across renderers."
msgstr "Bangun rantai pemecah-ikon bersama: resolver plugin `rehype` terlebih dahulu, lalu sebuah\n`resolve` eksplisit, kemudian set ikon pantoken bawaan. Digunakan oleh `@pantoken/rehype` dan\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` sehingga urutan resolusi tetap identik di semua renderer."

#: formats/icons/src/functions/getIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Look up an icon by name."
msgstr "Cari ikon berdasarkan nama."

#: formats/icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/icons` — an ergonomic view over the IR's `<image>` tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/icons` — an ergonomic view over the IR's `&lt;image&gt;` tokens."

#: formats/icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This is not a second source; it filters the canonical IR from `@pantoken/tokens` to the icon\ntokens and decodes each data-URI back to inline SVG, exposing a shape close to the\n`SimpleIconTokenData` that markdown/rehype consumers already use."
msgstr "Ini bukan sumber kedua; ia memfilter IR kanonis dari `@pantoken/tokens` ke ikon\ntoken dan mendekode setiap data-URI kembali menjadi SVG inline, menampilkan bentuk yang mirip dengan\n`SimpleIconTokenData` yang sudah digunakan oleh konsumen markdown/rehype."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options shared by the icon-resolving renderers ([buildIconResolverChain](../functions/buildIconResolverChain.md))."
msgstr "Opsi yang dibagikan oleh renderer yang menyelesaikan ikon ([buildIconResolverChain](../functions/buildIconResolverChain.md))."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An explicit resolver, tried before the built-in pantoken icon set."
msgstr "Sebuah resolver eksplisit, dicoba sebelum set ikon bawaan pantoken."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Plugins whose `rehype` hooks contribute resolvers (tried first)."
msgstr "Plugin yang hook `rehype` mereka menyumbang resolver (dicoba terlebih dahulu)."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pantoken icon, derived from an `<image>` token."
msgstr "A pantoken icon, derived from an `&lt;image&gt;` token."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name, without the `--instui-icon-` prefix (e.g. `arrow-left`)."
msgstr "Nama ikon, tanpa prefiks `--instui-icon-` (mis. `arrow-left`)."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,…')` value, as stored in the IR."
msgstr "Nilai `url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,…')`, sebagaimana disimpan dalam IR."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decoded inline SVG markup, stripped of `<script>` elements and event-handler attributes.\nOriginates from the vendored IR (pinned upstream). Safe for trusted injection contexts;\nconsumers should not treat this as safe for injection into attacker-controlled HTML."
msgstr "The decoded inline SVG markup, stripped of `&lt;script&gt;` elements and event-handler attributes.\nOriginates from the vendored IR (pinned upstream). Safe for trusted injection contexts;\nconsumers should not treat this as safe for injection into attacker-controlled HTML."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The SVG `viewBox`, when known."
msgstr "SVG `viewBox`, jika diketahui."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether the icon flips horizontally in right-to-left contexts."
msgstr "Apakah ikon membalik secara horizontal dalam konteks kanan-ke-kiri."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph origin."
msgstr "Asal glif."

#: formats/icons/src/variables/icons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every pantoken icon, sorted by name."
msgstr "Setiap ikon pantoken, diurutkan berdasarkan nama."

#: formats/icons/src/variables/iconsByName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every pantoken icon, keyed by name."
msgstr "Setiap ikon pantoken, diindeks berdasarkan nama."

#: formats/icons/src/variables/resolve.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An [IconResolver](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md) backed by the pantoken icon set (for the plugin/rehype stages)."
msgstr "Sebuah [IconResolver](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md) yang didukung oleh set ikon pantoken (untuk tahap plugin/rehype)."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/applySpacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply InstUI/CSS spacing attributes on `host` to inline style."
msgstr "Terapkan atribut spasi InstUI/CSS pada `host` ke gaya inline."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/applySpacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Managed properties are cleared first, so removing an attribute removes its style."
msgstr "Properti yang dikelola dibersihkan terlebih dahulu, jadi menghapus atribut akan menghapus gayanya."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a close button to dismiss its target."
msgstr "Hubungkan tombol tutup untuk menutup targetnya."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `<dialog>`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"
msgstr "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss strategy:\n- `<dialog>` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"
msgstr "Dismiss strategy:\n- `&lt;dialog&gt;` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a contenteditable field for click-to-edit commit/revert behaviour.\nEnter commits, Escape reverts; blur also commits if the value changed.\nFires a bubbling `change` CustomEvent with `detail.value` on commit."
msgstr "Menghubungkan field contenteditable untuk perilaku klik-untuk-ubah dengan commit/revert.\nEnter melakukan commit, Escape membatalkan (revert); blur juga melakukan commit jika nilainya berubah.\nMemicu sebuah CustomEvent `change` yang bersifat bubbling dengan `detail.value` saat commit."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (which IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"
msgstr "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit elemen (yang ADALAH contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a CSS `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` or a web component's shadow\n`<dialog>` to the `open` attribute protocol and `--show/--close/--toggle`\ncommand routing. Both usages pass the same interface:"
msgstr "Sambungkan sebuah CSS `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` atau shadow komponen web\n`<dialog>` ke protokol atribut `open` dan perutean\nperintah `--show/--close/--toggle`. Kedua penggunaan meneruskan antarmuka yang sama:"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS: `host === dialog` (the dialog itself carries the id and open attr)\n- WC: `host` = custom element, `dialog` = its shadow `<dialog>`"
msgstr "- CSS: `host === dialog` (the dialog itself carries the id and open attr)\n- WC: `host` = custom element, `dialog` = its shadow `&lt;dialog&gt;`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Release a ProgressCircle's mount-animation modifier after its configured delay."
msgstr "Lepaskan modifier mount-animation pada ProgressCircle setelah jeda yang dikonfigurasikan."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The delay is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless\n`--animation-delay` custom property. Missing, negative, and non-finite values become zero. Both the\ncanonical modifier and its deprecated typo alias are accepted and removed."
msgstr "Jeda adalah opsi eksplisit dalam milidetik atau properti kustom target yang dihitung, tanpa satuan\n`--animation-delay`. Nilai yang hilang, negatif, dan tak hingga menjadi nol. Baik modifier kanonik maupun alias salah ejaan yang usang diterima dan dihapus."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove a target after a timeout. Before removal, fires a cancelable, bubbling `dismiss` event.\nPreventing that event keeps the target mounted."
msgstr "Menghapus sebuah target setelah timeout. Sebelum penghapusan, memicu event `dismiss` yang dapat dibatalkan dan bubbling.\nMencegah event tersebut membuat target tetap terpasang."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The timeout is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless `--timeout` CSS\ncustom property. Missing, non-finite, and non-positive values don't arm a timer. A fade uses the\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` utility's classes (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), then waits\nfor `transitionend` (with a fallback); `transition: \"none\"` removes immediately."
msgstr "Timeout adalah opsi milidetik eksplisit atau properti kustom CSS unitless `--timeout` yang dihitung pada target.\nNilai yang hilang, tak hingga, dan bernilai tidak positif tidak akan mengaktifkan timer. Efek pudar menggunakan kelas utilitas `@pantoken/components` `transition` (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), lalu menunggu `transitionend` (dengan fallback); `transition: \"none\"` menghapus segera."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire open/close commands plus width-based responsive overlay switching onto a host: any\ncollapsible side panel (e.g. a drawer's tray) can import this interaction rather than each\ncomponent reimplementing it."
msgstr "Memasang perintah buka/tutup serta pengalihan overlay responsif berbasis lebar ke sebuah host: setiap panel samping yang dapat dilipat (mis. baki laci) dapat mengimpor interaksi ini alih-alih setiap\nkomponen mengimplementasikannya kembali."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire hover/focus show-hide with delay onto a tooltip wrapper and its tip\nbubble. Returns a cleanup function for use in web component disconnectedCallback."
msgstr "Menghubungkan aksi tampil/sembunyi pada hover/focus dengan penundaan ke pembungkus tooltip dan gelembung tipnya.\nMengembalikan fungsi pembersihan untuk digunakan dalam disconnectedCallback komponen web."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = its .tip child\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"
msgstr "  CSS:  wrapper = elemen .instui-tooltip, tip = anak .tip-nya\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep `--lines` in sync with available height for an auto-clamped truncate target."
msgstr "Pastikan `--lines` tetap sinkron dengan tinggi yang tersedia untuk target pemangkasan yang dibatasi otomatis."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS usage: pass the same element as `host` and `target`.\n- Web-component usage: pass custom-element host + shadow truncate target span."
msgstr "- Penggunaan CSS: berikan elemen yang sama sebagai `host` dan `target`.\n- Penggunaan web-component: berikan host elemen kustom + span target pemangkasan di shadow."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/makeOnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the `command`-event router: forward a target's `command` events to a handler, and where the\nInvoker Commands API is missing, delegate matching `commandfor` clicks across the target's tree."
msgstr "Bangun router acara `command`: teruskan event `command` dari sebuah target ke sebuah handler, dan di mana\nInvoker Commands API tidak tersedia, delegasikan klik `commandfor` yang sesuai ke seluruh pohon target."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/resolveSpace.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve one spacing value: keyword alias to token, otherwise pass through unchanged."
msgstr "Menyelesaikan satu nilai spasi: alias kata kunci menjadi token, jika tidak, teruskan tanpa perubahan."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve a 1-4 value InstUI spacing shorthand (`margin`/`padding`) to its CSS value."
msgstr "Ubah singkatan spasi InstUI berisi 1-4 nilai (`margin`/`padding`) menjadi nilai CSS-nya."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncInvoker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `<button>`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."
msgstr "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `&lt;button&gt;`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncTruncateAutoLines.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compute and apply a numeric `--lines` value from available height."
msgstr "Hitung dan terapkan nilai numerik `--lines` dari tinggi yang tersedia."

#: formats/interactions/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/interactions` - per-component interaction bundles for InstUI components."
msgstr "`@pantoken/interactions` - bundel interaksi per-komponen untuk komponen InstUI."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "Bentuk `command`/`source` dari Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (belum ada dalam tipe DOM lib)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`bubbles`** dari antarmuka Event menunjukkan apakah event menggelembung (bubbles) melalui pohon DOM atau tidak."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Properti **`cancelBubble`** dari antarmuka Event telah usang. Gunakan Event.stopPropagation() sebagai gantinya. Menetapkan nilainya ke true sebelum kembali dari event handler mencegah propagasi event. Dalam implementasi selanjutnya, menetapkannya ke false tidak berpengaruh. Lihat Browser compatibility untuk detail."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`cancelable`** dari antarmuka Event menunjukkan apakah event dapat dibatalkan, dan dengan demikian dapat dicegah seolah-olah event tidak pernah terjadi."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`composed`** dari antarmuka Event mengembalikan nilai boolean yang menunjukkan apakah event akan merambat melintasi batas shadow DOM ke DOM standar atau tidak."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`currentTarget`** dari antarmuka Event mengidentifikasi elemen tempat event handler dipasang."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`defaultPrevented`** dari antarmuka Event mengembalikan nilai boolean yang menunjukkan apakah pemanggilan Event.preventDefault() membatalkan event."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`eventPhase`** dari antarmuka Event menunjukkan fase aliran event yang sedang dievaluasi."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`isTrusted`** dari antarmuka Event adalah nilai boolean yang true ketika event dihasilkan oleh agen pengguna (termasuk melalui tindakan pengguna dan metode programatik seperti HTMLElement.focus()), dan false ketika event dipanggil melalui EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). Satu pengecualian adalah event click, yang menginisialisasi properti isTrusted menjadi false pada user agent."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Properti Event **`returnValue`** menunjukkan apakah aksi default untuk event ini telah dicegah atau tidak."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "**`Event.srcElement`** yang sudah usang adalah alias untuk properti Event.target. Gunakan Event.target sebagai gantinya."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`target`** dari antarmuka Event adalah referensi ke objek tempat event dipanggil. Ini berbeda dari Event.currentTarget ketika event handler dipanggil selama fase bubbling atau capturing."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`timeStamp`** dari antarmuka Event mengembalikan waktu (dalam milidetik) saat event dibuat."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Properti baca-saja **`type`** dari antarmuka Event mengembalikan string yang berisi tipe event. Ini diset saat event dikonstruksi dan merupakan nama yang umum digunakan untuk merujuk pada event tertentu, seperti click, load, atau error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Metode **`composedPath()`** dari antarmuka Event mengembalikan path event yang merupakan array objek tempat listener akan dipanggil. Ini tidak termasuk node dalam shadow tree jika shadow root dibuat dengan ShadowRoot.mode tertutup."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Metode **`Event.initEvent()`** digunakan untuk menginisialisasi nilai sebuah event yang dibuat menggunakan Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "Metode **`preventDefault()`** dari antarmuka Event memberi tahu user agent bahwa event sedang ditangani secara eksplisit, sehingga aksi defaultnya, seperti pengguliran halaman, navigasi tautan, atau menempel teks, tidak boleh dilakukan."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "Metode **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** dari antarmuka Event mencegah listener lain untuk event yang sama dipanggil."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "Metode **`stopPropagation()`** dari antarmuka Event mencegah propagasi lebih lanjut dari event saat ini dalam fase capturing dan bubbling. Namun, ini tidak mencegah perilaku default terjadi; misalnya, klik pada tautan tetap akan diproses. Jika ingin menghentikan perilaku tersebut, lihat metode preventDefault(). Ini juga tidak mencegah propagasi ke event-handler lain pada elemen saat ini. Jika ingin menghentikan itu, lihat stopImmediatePropagation()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initProgressCircle](../functions/initProgressCircle.md)."
msgstr "Penangan yang dikembalikan oleh [initProgressCircle](../functions/initProgressCircle.md)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cancel the pending mount animation."
msgstr "Batalkan animasi mount yang tertunda."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Release the mount state immediately."
msgstr "Lepaskan status mount segera."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the ProgressCircle mount animation."
msgstr "Opsi untuk animasi mount ProgressCircle."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds before the mount state is released. Defaults to computed `--animation-delay`."
msgstr "Millisekon sebelum status mount dilepaskan. Defaultnya adalah `--animation-delay` yang dihitung."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initRemove](../functions/initRemove.md)."
msgstr "Handle yang dikembalikan oleh [initRemove](../functions/initRemove.md)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cancel pending dismissal and removal work."
msgstr "Batalkan pekerjaan penutupan dan penghapusan yang tertunda."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss immediately, without waiting for the configured timeout."
msgstr "Tutup segera, tanpa menunggu batas waktu yang dikonfigurasi."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for a timeout-based removal."
msgstr "Opsi untuk penghapusan berbasis batas waktu."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds before dismissal. Defaults to the target's computed `--timeout`."
msgstr "Millisekon sebelum penghapusan. Defaultnya adalah `--timeout` yang dihitung dari target."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Exit treatment. Defaults to `\"fade\"`, matching InstUI Alert."
msgstr "Perilaku saat keluar. Defaultnya adalah `\"fade\"`, sesuai dengan InstUI Alert."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initTooltip](../functions/initTooltip.md)."
msgstr "Handle yang dikembalikan oleh [initTooltip](../functions/initTooltip.md)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove all event listeners and cancel any pending timer."
msgstr "Hapus semua event listener dan batalkan timer yang tertunda."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Immediately cancel any pending show timer and remove `-show`."
msgstr "Segera batalkan timer tampil yang tertunda dan hapus `-show`."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for show/hide timing."
msgstr "Opsi untuk waktu tampil/sembunyikan."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md)."
msgstr "Handle yang dikembalikan oleh [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Force a recompute of the derived `--lines` value."
msgstr "Paksa perhitungan ulang nilai turunan `--lines`."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove observers/listeners created by init."
msgstr "Hapus pengamat/pendengar yang dibuat oleh init."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional knobs for [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md)."
msgstr "Pengaturan opsional untuk [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Observe the host's parent size (default true)."
msgstr "Amati ukuran induk host (nilai default true)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional slot to watch for `slotchange` re-syncs in shadow DOM usage."
msgstr "Slot opsional untuk dipantau untuk penyinkronan ulang `slotchange` dalam penggunaan shadow DOM."

#: formats/interactions/src/type-aliases/CommandHandler.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Callback invoked when a `command` event (or fallback click) resolves to a target."
msgstr "Callback dipanggil ketika sebuah event `command` (atau klik fallback) mengarah ke suatu target."

#: formats/interactions/src/type-aliases/OnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Command-event wiring function: bind one target to a handler, with click fallback when needed."
msgstr "Fungsi pengkabelan perintah-ke-peristiwa: mengikat satu target ke penangkap, dengan fallback klik saat diperlukan."

