#: packages/core/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/core` — the pantoken transformer."
msgstr "`@pantoken/core` — transformer pantoken."

#: packages/core/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\nthe native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`) lives on the separate\n`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry stays free of that exotic dependency."
msgstr "Menetapkan kontrak plugin seragam ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md))) dan menyesuaikan IR token yang telah diselesaikan untuk\njalur native ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md))). Transform yang menyelesaikan upstream (`buildTokens`,\nyang membutuhkan GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`)) berada di entri terpisah\n`@pantoken/core/build`, sehingga entri utama ini tetap bebas dari dependensi eksotik tersebut."

#: packages/core/src/interfaces/AssetFile.md
#, no-c-format
