msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema Foundation for Sites dengan token Instructure."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation dirancang untuk Sass terlebih dahulu, jadi paket ini mengirimkan dua lapisan. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) menghasilkan sebuah\npartial Sass bergaya `_settings` yang mengarahkan variabel pengaturan Foundation ke `var(--instui-*)`, sehingga\nbuild Sass mengompilasi tampilan Instructure sambil mempertahankan theming runtime melalui properti kustom yang sama. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) menghasilkan overlay CSS tipis yang memberi tema pada kelas terkompilasi umum\n(`.button`, `.callout`, links) dengan cara yang sama — berguna ketika Anda mengonsumsi CSS Foundation bawaan\ndan hanya ingin menumpangkan warna Instructure di atasnya tanpa mengompilasi ulang."

