msgstr "variabel CSS shadcn → token Instructure yang dihasilkannya."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a Storybook theme from the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "Buat tema Storybook dari token Instructure."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`\"light\"` or `\"dark\"` (default `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "`\"light\"` atau `\"dark\"` (bawaan `\"light\"`)."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `ThemeVars`-shaped object."
msgstr "Sebuah objek berbentuk `ThemeVars`."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/storybook` — a Storybook theme built from Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/storybook` — sebuah tema Storybook yang dibuat dari token Instructure."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) returns a plain `ThemeVars`-shaped object (so `@storybook/theming`\nstays an optional peer) with colours resolved concretely from the IR. Pass it to Storybook's\n`manager`/`preview` theme."
msgstr "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) mengembalikan objek berbentuk `ThemeVars` biasa (jadi `@storybook/theming`\nstays an optional peer) dengan warna yang diselesaikan secara konkret dari IR. Berikan ke tema Storybook's\n`manager`/`preview`."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"
msgstr "Mengganti nama dan mengekspor ulang [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"

#: renderers/storybook/src/type-aliases/StorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Storybook theme object (a subset of `ThemeVars`)."
msgstr "Sebuah objek tema Storybook (subkumpulan dari `ThemeVars`)."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Svelte action: `<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` renders the icon's inline SVG into the node."
msgstr "Aksi Svelte: `<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` merender SVG inline ikon ke dalam node."

