#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-icon>` — an inline SVG glyph from the pantoken icon set. The `name` attribute picks the\nglyph, `size` (any CSS length, default `1em`) sizes it, `color` (any CSS color) tints it, and\n`margin` adds spacing around it (InstUI keywords like `small`). Renders the SVG into its own light\nDOM, sized/coloured via inline styles on the host, so it inherits `currentColor` like text."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-icon&gt;` — an inline SVG glyph from the pantoken icon set. The `name` attribute picks the\nglyph, `size` (any CSS length, default `1em`) sizes it, `color` (any CSS color) tints it, and\n`margin` adds spacing around it (InstUI keywords like `small`). Renders the SVG into its own light\nDOM, sized/coloured via inline styles on the host, so it inherits `currentColor` like text."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/iconButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-icon-button>` — an icon-only, square button. `label` becomes the button's `aria-label`;\nslotted content is the glyph (e.g. an `<instui-icon>`)."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-icon-button&gt;` — an icon-only, square button. `label` becomes the button's `aria-label`;\nslotted content is the glyph (e.g. an `&lt;instui-icon&gt;`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/id.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Indonesian locale bundle."
msgstr "Bundel lokal bahasa Indonesia."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-img>` — a token-styled `<img>` built from `src`/`alt`. `constrain` maps to\n`-constrain-<value>` (e.g. `cover`, `contain`) and `display=\"block\"` to `-display-block`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-img&gt;` — a token-styled `&lt;img&gt;` built from `src`/`alt`. `constrain` maps to\n`-constrain-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `cover`, `contain`) and `display=\"block\"` to `-display-block`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-in-place-edit>` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as text; on click/focus it becomes\neditable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with `detail.value`), and\nEscape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An external `value` change\nreflects into the field while it isn't being edited."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-in-place-edit&gt;` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as text; on click/focus it becomes\neditable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with `detail.value`), and\nEscape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An external `value` change\nreflects into the field while it isn't being edited."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/is.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icelandic (Íslenska) locale bundle."
msgstr "Bundle lokal Islandia (Íslenska)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/it.md
#, no-c-format
