msgstr "Nama paket, mis. `@pantoken/astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregation key / export name, e.g. `astro`."
msgstr "Kunci agregasi / nama ekspor, mis. `astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How the target is exposed:\n- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers like React, so\n  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr "Bagaimana target diekspos:\n- `namespace` — diekspor ulang ke dalam eager barrel *dan* sebagai subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath mengimpor entri `/inject` paket; juga ada di barrel.\n- `subpath` — hanya subpath, disimpan DI LUAR eager barrel (untuk peer berat seperti React, sehingga\n  `import \"pantoken\"` tidak pernah memuatnya)."

